# ─── macOS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*

# ─── Camera originals and master artwork ─────────────────────────────────
# ~130 MB. Already safe in Dropbox, and GitHub warns above 50 MB per file.
# site/media/ holds the web-sized versions the page actually serves.
IMG_*.jpeg
IMG_*.MOV
IMG_*.mov
Line Drawings/
SVG Line Drawings/

# ─── Generated ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The self-contained Artifact build: ~8 MB of base64 that changes in full on
# every build, which would bloat the history fast. Rebuild it with build.py.
# (site/index.html is generated too, but IS committed — it is the website.)
dist/

# ─── Local tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/

# ─── Stray, left behind by some other tool ───────────────────────────────
{{pkgetc}}/
